BSP.rs is an independent Rust implementation of baseline Backtracking Survey
Propagation and WalkSAT completion. It was extracted from the pybsp development
workspace maintained by Carlo Nicolini.

Algorithm and baseline reference: the original C++ BSP code by Raffaele Marino:
https://github.com/CarloNicolini/pybsp
The new Rust solver does not link to or invoke that C++ solver. The optional
comparison harness in bench/cpp_kernel.cpp follows its GPL-licensed SP loop.

